      ],
      "prompt": "Read ./SKILL.md completely (open references/composable-product-portfolio-method.md before classifying), then write portfolio-contract.md for this portfolio: one platform that also ships a mobile app, a dashboard, and an API SDK, with a shared auth substrate and a billing connector. For every proposed unit: standalone job, contract, lifecycle, operational/commercial obligations, and support path. Classify each surface (product, embedded capability, shared substrate, connector, composed experience, bundle). Draw the product and connector graph with every edge naming its contract and state owner. Give keep/extract/merge/retire decisions with evidence and handoffs, and show composition does not create a hidden monolith or fragmented system.",
      "timeoutMs": 600000,
      "oracle": {
        "assertions": [
          {
            "type": "file-exists",
            "path": "portfolio-contract.md"
          },
          {
            "type": "file-regex",
            "path": "portfolio-contract.md",
            "contains": "standalone",
